# =========================================================================
# a2a_v1 — the A2A protocol v1.0 on its JSON-RPC binding (2.6.0, ADR 040).
#
# The Agent Card, and `POST /a2a`, whose tasks are crews: the version header,
# every method's answer and refusal, the crew a message starts and the task it
# reads back as, and what a task costs the global heap once its crew goes back.
# `server_routes_a2a.tcyr` pins the Rust line's `/api/v1/a2a/receive`, which
# stays as it was.
#
# Stdlib is auto-prepended from cyrius.cyml — do NOT include stdlib modules.
# =========================================================================

